How to work (this is required, see "Working protocol" in app.md):
- Go one step at a time. Before each step, explain the concept in plain text with no
  diagrams. Then do the step, run or give me the exact command to run, report real
  output, and STOP and wait for me before the next step.
- Do not create more files than the current step needs.
